`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.p,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Sonnet"})," is the daily driver. Sonnet 5 brings strong reasoning to the kind of work you do every day: coding, writing, analysis, research, and complex problem-solving. It's responsive enough for real-time collaboration and capable enough that most problems won't outgrow it. It also handles computer use, vision tasks, and document and spreadsheet creation well, making it a versatile default across a wide range of work. If you're not sure which model to pick, start here."]}),`
